Student Management System

A console-based student management system developed using Python.

Features
Add student records
Display student records
Search students
Delete student records
Calculate total marks
Calculate percentage
Calculate grade automatically
Technologies Used
Python
How to Run
Download or clone this repository.
Open the project folder in VS Code.
Open the Python file.
Run the program using Python.

Example:

python student.py
Project Purpose

This project was developed to practice Python programming, functions, conditional statements, loops, data structures, and basic record management.
